{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 17, :comments ["After I learned the wisdoms and increased, I set my heart to know the essence of הוללות, as in 'ויתהולל בידם' (and they raged), and the essence of שכלות, which is the opposite of הוללות — even though this is a thought of vapor."], :book :ecclesiastes, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 1, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["Wikisource" "https://he.wikisource.org/wiki/%D7%90%D7%91%D7%9F_%D7%A2%D7%96%D7%A8%D7%90_%D7%A2%D7%9C_%D7%A7%D7%94%D7%9C%D7%AA"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T18:27:26.350505366Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}